From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:27:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 15/45] clk: ingenic: Add X2600 CGU driver

Add support for the clock generation unit of the Ingenic X2600: the
APLL, MPLL and EPLL, the CPU, L2 cache, AHB, APB and DDR clocks, the
peripheral clocks with their CDR dividers, and the CLKGR0/CLKGR1 gates.

The PLLs have two post-dividers in series, described with the second
post-divider field of the CGU code. Ingenic does not document the VCO
range; new rates are kept within that of the PLL settings Ingenic
lists, all of which this driver reproduces exactly.

The register layout follows Ingenic's X2600 SDK kernel.
