 drivers/clk/ingenic/Makefile    |   1 +
 drivers/clk/ingenic/x2600-cgu.c | 629 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 642 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/ingenic/x2600-cgu.c

